<title>BELGIUM: EU to block Anglo's Lonrho stake on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>EU to block Anglo's Lonrho stake on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is expected to block Anglo American Corp of South Africa's 28-percent stake in British conglomerate Lonrho Plc on Wednesday, European Union and industry sources said.</p>
</text>
